<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vintage Petroleum cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vintage Petroleum cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Thomas Driscoll said he cut his rating on shares of Vintage Petroleum Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;(It's) still a great company but shares are up very strongly,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- By 1345 EDT/1745 GMT on Tuesday, Vintage shares were up 3/8 at 29-3/4, close to their year high of 29 7/8. The stock has risen from a year low of 19.</p>
</text>
